      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Coal along Peter Creek became a major part of Phelps’ history, fueling the town’s early growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
