        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://appalachianhistorian.org/phelps-pike-county-peter-creek-matthew-t-scott-academy-and-a-coalfield-community-that-remained/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Phelps High School traces its roots to a one-room elementary school that marked the start of formal education in the area.",
